    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know you're trying to be nice but it feels impossible. it’s not just about being shy or nothing. it's like there is this massive wall between me and everyone else. if nobody sees me or cares if i'm here or not... does any of this really even matter? it feels like i'm just taking up space for no reason.",
