    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it’s just so tiring. the idea of finding \"peace\" or just \"being\" feels like a joke when the reality is just being alone in a room that feels too big. sometimes i think if i just stopped existing, it would be quieter. like, if there's no impact, there's no pain. it almost feels like the most logical way to stop feeling so heavy.",
